  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="f6604089-9f20-5f4b-9106-6cffa1861161" activityNameId="6778f000-71d5-59fc-b776-e805f2548779" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Label housing system, pig</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Label housing system, pig
The module includes a pen for fattening pigs with animal-friendly housing system with multispace pens and exercise area, fittings, slurry store, concentrate silo, wet mix feeding system and straw storage area. Size: 300 pig places. Lifetime of the building is 50 years.;
UUID: b4f8a3f8-f053-3d3e-9fb4-65795da34d1b
The inventory takes into account the use of construction materials and building machines for construction, repair and replacement including waste disposal and the transportation of the materials to the building site. Not taken into account were direct emission of the construction, disposal of production waste and the use of resources during utilization phase. 
Location: The inventory applies for Swiss agricultural buildings only, because of the solid method of construction.
Technology: The data of the inventory are based on one example of a typical agricultural building.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: The inventory is calculated based on a solid database of agricultural buildings. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b4f8a3f8-f053-3d3e-9fb4-65795da34d1b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
